<p>Pouring more energy into your rifts, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 20%, 26%, 31%, 35%</acronym> chance for each one to instead appear as a more powerful type.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Nether Breach:</span></span> Fires a beam dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">35, 47, 56, 64, 71</acronym> darkness damage at a random target in radius 10.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Temporal Vortex:</span></span> Inflicts <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> temporal damage each turn to enemies in radius 4 and reduces their global speed by 30%.</p><p><span style="color: #80008b"><span class="tstr-color-PURPLE">Dimensional Gate:</span></span> Has a 50% chance each turn to summon a voidling lasting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns; a fast melee attacker that can teleport.</p><p>The stats of your Void Skitterers will scale with your Magic stat and level.</p>